  "content": [
    {
      "text": "Mormon2 makes abridgment from plates of Nephi, W of M 1:3 (Morm. 6:6). Mormon2 puts small plates with remainder of his record, W of M 1:6. Mormon2 proceeds to finish his record, W of M 1:9. Mormon2 makes record on plates he has made with own hands, 3 Ne. 5:10–11. upon these plates Mormon2 does not make full account of wickedness, Morm. 2:18. Mormon2 gives Moroni2 few plates, Morm. 6:6. Moroni2 finishes father’s record, Morm. 8:1. Moroni2 seals up record, Moro. 10:2.",
